<title>UK: BOC shares off, Merrill Lynch cautious.</title>
<headline>BOC shares off, Merrill Lynch cautious.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in chemicals company BOC Group Plc fell on Friday after Merrill Lynch said the shares had risen far enough for the moment, market sources said.</p>
<p>They said Merrill Lynch analyst Robin Coombes had told clients the shares had limited upside in the near-term.</p>
<p>The shares were 12p lower at 10.54 stg by 0833 GMT.</p>
